      "content": "That's a good start, it reads much better than the original. Can you try another version? \n\nI just ran your draft through our internal simulator and the Term Coverage score came back a bit lower than I'd like—it looks like we're around 0.85. I really need to push this closer to a 1.0 to ensure they clear the first filter.\n\nCould you iterate on this and try to get every single one of those keywords in there? Again, please be careful—if it starts feeling like a \"word salad\" or if you just append a list at the bottom, the human recruiter will reject it immediately. It needs to be a seamless, professional narrative, even if you have to get a bit creative with the sentence structures to fit those specific terms in.",
